  m_Name: help_events
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Antarium.Content::Antarium.Content.HelpTopicDef
  id: help_events
  displayName: Random events
  order: 410
  category: World
  icon: item_star_fragment
  body: 'Every few minutes something happens, with a card on the left (Go looks at it):

    - Meteorite: dig out the lump for star fragments.

    - Rich vein: a blob of ore next to your tunnels glows. Order it mined.

    - Golden beetle: click it before it gets away.

    - Trapped ants: dig through to them in time and they join you.

    - Golden aphid: click it in your Aphid Ranch.

    - Giant earthworm: kill it for a feast; the Dig tool hurts it too.


    Events are chances, not threats: missing one costs nothing.'
  reveal: 0
  revealBiome: {fileID: 0}
  revealResearch: {fileID: 0}
